# Repo-wide safety net — catches node_modules and other build/dev artifacts
# no matter how deeply nested, since each app's own .gitignore only covers
# its own root (see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-code-structure-cleanup-design.md).

# dependencies
**/node_modules/

# env files
.env
.env*.local

# next.js / build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
